WEBVTT

00:11:29.309 --> 00:11:32.896
First, I had to pull back
that white sheet.

00:11:34.314 --> 00:11:37.985
For weeks and weeks, I'd been hearing
my wife tell me how great it looked.

00:11:38.652 --> 00:11:40.654
She helped me get to that point.

00:11:41.196 --> 00:11:42.406
I was ready.

00:11:43.449 --> 00:11:46.326
And when I finally did it,

00:11:46.368 --> 00:11:49.413
it looked way worse than I had expected.

00:11:49.455 --> 00:11:51.582
(Laughter)

00:11:52.416 --> 00:11:54.418
What I saw was not cool.

00:11:54.835 --> 00:11:56.170
It was grotesque.

00:11:57.045 --> 00:11:58.964
Mangled and deformed.

00:11:59.423 --> 00:12:01.884
All kinds of purple and blue and red.